(a) whether Government is working to replicate the success of Sikkim in organic farming across other States, particularly in hilly and tribal areas and the incentives provided to farmers for transitioning to organic farming;
(b) the steps taken to reduce the cost and time involved in organic certification, including simplification of procedures;
(c) the measures undertaken to facilitate branding and global marketing of organic products, on the lines of initiatives adopted in Sikkim; and
(d) whether Government provides any financial or technical assistance to farmers facing income fluctuations during the transition period from conventional to organic farming?
