(a) whether AI-based technologies are being deployed for traffic management, including reduction of congestion, enforcement of traffic rules and prevention of road accidents;
(b) if so, details of AI-enabled systems deployed, including their nature and scope, State-wise and city-wise, particularly in Delhi;
(c) whether any assessment has been conducted on impact of such interventions on traffic violations, congestion and road accidents and if so, details thereof;
(d) funds allocated and utilised for such systems during last three years, State-wise; and
(e) steps taken or proposed to expand use of AI and data analytics for road safety and traffic management, especially in high-density urban areas?

(a) total number of Garima Greh shelters operational, bed capacity, year-wise occupancy and year-wise number of beneficiaries over last five years, shelter-wise;
(b) funds allocated, released and utilised for each shelter, including expenditure on food, healthcare, counselling and skill-development programs, State-wise and year-wise;
(c) sanctioned staff positions versus in position, with role-wise vacancies and reasons for shortfall;
(d) number of NGO/CBO proposals received for new shelters, number approved, rejected or pending and reasons for delays;
(e) number of beneficiaries rehabilitated, placed in employment or enrolled in skill programs, year-wise and State-wise; and
(f) number of complaints received regarding safety, harassment, inadequate facilities, State-wise, including resolution status? 
