(a) whether Government has received representations seeking GST rationalisation on Air Purifiers and Water Purifiers in view of increasing air pollution and water contamination levels in several parts of the country;
(b) whether the issue of classifying such products as essential or preventive healthcare devices has been examined by Government, if so, the details thereof;
(c) the GST revenue collected from Air Purifiers and water Purifiers during the last five financial years, year-wise; and
(d) whether the matter has been placed or proposed to be placed before the GST Council for consideration, if so the details and timeline thereof?
