(d) current status and expected timeline of the Delhi-Alwar-Reengas-Fatehpur Shekhawati railway line, sanctioned in 2013?

(a) whether Government proposes to identify and develop a dedicated Jain circuit as a thematic tourism circuit, on the lines of Buddhist circuit under the Swadesh Darshan scheme;
(b) if so, the details of Jain religious and heritage sites proposed to be included in such a circuit, State-wise;
(c) whether any proposal in this regard have been received from State Governments or other stakeholders and if so, the details thereof;
(d) the estimated cost, funding pattern and timeline for development of proposed Jain circuit; and
(e) the steps proposed to promote Jain tourism at the national and international level?

(a) whether Government is aware that several spas and massage centres across Delhi and other cities are functioning as fronts for prostitution rackets where young Indian and foreign women are trafficked and commercially sexually exploited;
