(c) whether Government is considering banning cross-gender massage in the country; and
(d) whether Government is considering setting up a regulatory framework for spas and massage centres to prevent sexual exploitation and trafficking?

(a) the number of IRDAI circulars or guidelines issued since 2018 to mandate disability-inclusive underwriting and premium norms in health insurance;
