(c) the number of NABL/APEDA-approved food testing laboratories, State-wise; and
(d) the steps taken to assist MSMEs and women-led enterprises to enhance their participation in processed food exports?

(a) the number of youth hostels constructed under Youth Hostel Scheme during the last five years, year-wise and State/UT-wise, along with their location and year of establishment;
(b) the funds allocated and utilised for their construction and maintenance during that period, year-wise and State/UT-wise;
(c) whether it is a fact that no youth hostel has been constructed or is currently operational in Delhi and if so, the reasons therefor;
(d) whether any proposal for a youth hostel in Delhi has been submitted and/or rejected during the last decade; and
(e) if not, whether Government plans to construct one and the proposed timeline?

(a) whether Government proposes to bring a dedicated law and notify rules under the Social Security Code, 2020 to provide legal recognition and social security to domestic workers;
(b) if so, the timeline for introducing such legislation and notification of rules and if not, the reasons for continued delay;
(c) the number of domestic workers registered on e-Shram portal, State/UT-wise; and
(d) the steps being taken to ensure health insurance, accident cover, old-age protection and grievance redressal for domestic workers until a legal framework is in place?

(a) number of students enrolled in Delhi University during the last three years, college-wise, year-wise, including a gender-wise breakup;
(b) total number of hostels available for students in Delhi University, along with their capacity and actual occupancy, college-wise and hostel-wise and gender-wise;
